Vasishtha orders fetch of Bharata and Shatrughna --- Vasishtha summons Siddhartha Vijaya Jayanta Ashokanandana --- Messengers hide Rama exile and king death --- Messengers carry silks jewels for king and Bharata --- Messengers cross Ganga Sharadanda Vipasha rivers --- Messengers pass Panchala Kurujangala Bahlika lands --- Exhausted riders reach Girivraja by night
